<title>UK: Deutsche Bank unit sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank unit sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BANK FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.50     MATURITY    19.SPE.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.00    PAY DATE    19.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 25	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.85	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
